OL,3,GNEWSAPodcaster James English found
OL,4,Aguilty of domestic abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish podcaster has been found
OL,7,Fguilty of domestic abuse against a
OL,8,Fformer partner.
OL,10,FJames English, 43, repeatedly attacked
OL,11,Fthe woman - a model and influencer - at
OL,12,Fa flat in Glasgow and elsewhere between
OL,13,FJuly 2022 and November 2023.
OL,15,FEnglish, from Larkhall, starred in
OL,16,FScottish reality TV show Glow, before
OL,17,Fbecoming the host of the Anything Goes
OL,18,Fpodcast which has more than 800,000
OL,19,Fsubscribers on YouTube.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
