OL,4,Aguilty of domestic abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was convicted of engaging in a
OL,7,Fcourse of behaviour which was abusive
OL,8,Fto a partner or ex-partner after a
OL,9,F12-day trial at Glasgow Sheriff Court.
